# Dutch Design form

- Pairing and accent come only from locked `design-plan.md`.
- `rounded-none`. Borders 1px structural or black. Hard offset shadow only, never blur.
- At least one planned rupture per major section. Grid must stay readable.
- Hover: inversion or chevron-axis translate. Never `scale-105` or fade-in-up.
- Motion: `--ease-overshoot`. No mixed easings.
- Semantic HTML. No card soup. No identical 3-up feature grids.
